    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "The purpose of this study is investigating the clinical characteristics of newly diagnosed, drug na\u00efve type 2 diabetic patients according to insulin secretion and insulin resistance.",
      "detailedDescription": "Primary Objective:To investigate whether insulin resistance or insulin deficiency is primary in the pathogenesis of type 2 diabetes mellitus in Korea Secondary Objectives:To investigate proportion of patients with severe insulin deficiency at diagnosis,To investigate proportion of metabolic syndrome in patients with newly diagnosed, drug-na\u00efve type 2 diabetes mellitus,To investigate proportion of obesity in patients with newly diagnosed, drug-na\u00efve type 2 diabetes mellitus"
    },
